{"schema_version":1,"id":"JK5W2AQDQFFSJ7ONTDRB3I35JD","conversation_id":"I5ALWOYPXCGWWOS6EANSCCTBC2","question":"绕过容器平台在节点上直接操作 EVS，会让 Pod 写到哪里，文档是否提供恢复方法？","status":"ANSWERED","data_mode":"LIVE","answer":"绕过容器平台在节点上直接操作 EVS（如控制台手动解除挂载 EVS）会导致 Pod 写入出现 IO Error 故障。

文档提供了恢复方法：删除节点上 mount 目录，重新调度 Pod。

节点上 umount 磁盘挂载路径会导致 Pod 写入本地磁盘；恢复方法是重新 mount 对应目录到 Pod 中。","claims":[{"text":"绕过容器平台在节点上直接操作 EVS（如控制台手动解除挂载 EVS）会导致 Pod 写入出现 IO Error 故障。","fragment_ids":["TCWUTC2DCHWM7HMY7HKDL64QRY"]},{"text":"文档提供了恢复方法：删除节点上 mount 目录，重新调度 Pod。","fragment_ids":["TCWUTC2DCHWM7HMY7HKDL64QRY"]},{"text":"节点上 umount 磁盘挂载路径会导致 Pod 写入本地磁盘；恢复方法是重新 mount 对应目录到 Pod 中。","fragment_ids":["6QIDDFHBKYHBCDCQOYVHSVYYF2"]}],"citations":[{"document_id":"4KQSU5JF6WRCVNEX3MMWYJVQS7","revision_id":"RUXOEMOVWG2QL4G4YZ37SM6357","fragment_id":"TCWUTC2DCHWM7HMY7HKDL64QRY","title":"华为云 CCE 高危操作一览","source":"https://support.huaweicloud.com/usermanual-cce/cce_10_0054.html","section":"cce-t7-r01 云硬盘 / 云硬盘","content_hash":"a0547f3aa1f38c705d7271c676e3ad107e39947180836aeb38ee0636dce55324","url":"/v1/knowledge/revisions/RUXOEMOVWG2QL4G4YZ37SM6357/fragments/TCWUTC2DCHWM7HMY7HKDL64QRY","applicability":{"status":"MATCH","checks":[{"field":"scope","status":"MATCH","reason":"资料声明为通用知识。"}]}},{"document_id":"4KQSU5JF6WRCVNEX3MMWYJVQS7","revision_id":"RUXOEMOVWG2QL4G4YZ37SM6357","fragment_id":"6QIDDFHBKYHBCDCQOYVHSVYYF2","title":"华为云 CCE 高危操作一览","source":"https://support.huaweicloud.com/usermanual-cce/cce_10_0054.html","section":"cce-t7-r02 云硬盘 / 云硬盘","content_hash":"d4d9d94b07d9434f3a207c70f1edd3655512855f187bd234abfceb73d2f8d95a","url":"/v1/knowledge/revisions/RUXOEMOVWG2QL4G4YZ37SM6357/fragments/6QIDDFHBKYHBCDCQOYVHSVYYF2","applicability":{"status":"MATCH","checks":[{"field":"scope","status":"MATCH","reason":"资料声明为通用知识。"}]}}],"gaps":[],"created_at":"2026-09-19T21:53:13.804881Z","applicability_checks":[{"revision_id":"RUXOEMOVWG2QL4G4YZ37SM6357","status":"MATCH","checks":[{"field":"scope","status":"MATCH","reason":"资料声明为通用知识。"}]}],"trace_id":"785b71a7d8b540ccea6f62f0bffea4a5","retrieved_fragment_ids":["TCWUTC2DCHWM7HMY7HKDL64QRY","5OE4OST5LX3SWKTIUDXQB6XZAW","LPZQM2PTFK4J3QFC5LBNSZ2I63","I7DRU6FIQDNAMKI55BMR6MFJ6F","6QIDDFHBKYHBCDCQOYVHSVYYF2"],"model_usage":{"prompt_tokens":838,"completion_tokens":158,"total_tokens":