{"schema_version":1,"id":"CVFJRIKVTZBOS4BA5HTNPN3YH3","conversation_id":"F2BBCN4SXGF4J2GZ5WXYWJCGEA","question":"100 个节点的集群，云原生监控采集分片通常该配多少，配太多有什么风险？","status":"ANSWERED","data_mode":"LIVE","answer":"云原生监控采集分片的推荐配置为每50个节点配置一个采集分片，因此100个节点的集群推荐配置约2个采集分片。

采集分片数量超过推荐值会增加资源消耗，容易导致集群控制节点内存负载过高，影响系统稳定性。

误操作后应将云原生监控插件的采集分片数调整为推荐值。","claims":[{"text":"云原生监控采集分片的推荐配置为每50个节点配置一个采集分片，因此100个节点的集群推荐配置约2个采集分片。","fragment_ids":["7MCPJKLCDYI4OTZTJLQJBSUXEF"]},{"text":"采集分片数量超过推荐值会增加资源消耗，容易导致集群控制节点内存负载过高，影响系统稳定性。","fragment_ids":["7MCPJKLCDYI4OTZTJLQJBSUXEF"]},{"text":"误操作后应将云原生监控插件的采集分片数调整为推荐值。","fragment_ids":["7MCPJKLCDYI4OTZTJLQJBSUXEF"]}],"citations":[{"document_id":"4KQSU5JF6WRCVNEX3MMWYJVQS7","revision_id":"RUXOEMOVWG2QL4G4YZ37SM6357","fragment_id":"7MCPJKLCDYI4OTZTJLQJBSUXEF","title":"华为云 CCE 高危操作一览","source":"https://support.huaweicloud.com/usermanual-cce/cce_10_0054.html","section":"cce-t6-r01 监控 / 监控","content_hash":"09aa02d20d77fbe71c8e64f95e83a744165fd49fbf2b14779d7ad3c2517648ab","url":"/v1/knowledge/revisions/RUXOEMOVWG2QL4G4YZ37SM6357/fragments/7MCPJKLCDYI4OTZTJLQJBSUXEF","applicability":{"status":"MATCH","checks":[{"field":"scope","status":"MATCH","reason":"资料声明为通用知识。"}]}}],"gaps":[],"created_at":"2026-09-19T21:53:11.689258Z","applicability_checks":[{"revision_id":"RUXOEMOVWG2QL4G4YZ37SM6357","status":"MATCH","checks":[{"field":"scope","status":"MATCH","reason":"资料声明为通用知识。"}]}],"trace_id":"4d14f3f60bb8ac07dbed63bc2e961d0e","retrieved_fragment_ids":["7MCPJKLCDYI4OTZTJLQJBSUXEF","KEY3FPO4OBOW4K6F2TNDIXPT6J","JPOR4PIIYKFIOHU4UWWOAXGTXY","3AN4DP22X6DTGYMMIYOHO5WNLN","5JAXJXPC354A2HMCOE6D6JKQOW"],"model_usage":{"prompt_tokens":882,"completion_tokens":160,"total_tokens":1042,"calls":1}}

{"schema_version":1,"id":"F4YEIDQW62BVDNN3N6PR2OI6BS","conversation_id":"AJB7CERBPTLUJFZWQGS44I4MLR","question":"在 ELB 侧手工改了 Ingress 产生的转发规则，控制节点重启时会发生什么？","status":"ANSWERED","data_mode":"LIVE","answer":"通过ELB控制台修改CCE创建的监听器转发策略（添加、删除转发规则）会导致Service/Ingress访问不通。

如果该转发规则由Ingress添加，在集群升级等需要重启控制节点的场景，所做修改会被CCE侧重置。

误操作后不建议修改，请自行恢复。","claims":[{"text":"通过ELB控制台修改CCE创建的监听器转发策略（添加、删除转发规则）会导致Service/Ingress访问不通。","fragment_ids":["3CKLXXI7D6XJO6EDVF6WQKCOYS"]},{"text":"如果该转发规则由Ingress添加，在集群升级等需要重启控制节点的场景，所做修改会被CCE侧重置。","fragment_ids":["3CKLXXI7D6XJO6EDVF6WQKCOYS"]},{"text":"误操作后不建议修改，请自行恢复。","fragment_ids":["3CKLXXI7D6XJO6EDVF6WQKCOYS"]}],"citations":[{"document_id":"4KQSU5JF6WRCVNEX3MMWYJVQS7","revision_id":"RUXOEMOVWG2QL4G4YZ37SM6357","fragment_id":"3CKLXXI7D6XJO6EDVF6WQKCOYS","title":"华为云 CCE 高危操作一览","source":"https://support.huaweicloud.com/usermanual-cce/cce_10_0054.html","section":"cce-t4-r10 负载均衡 / 负载均衡","content_hash":"f5995e38cd71284bf2f658a272a5543f6e959e57c5c85274c1eb4d694dfb54a4","url":"/v1/knowledge/revisions/RUXOEMOVWG2QL4G4YZ37SM6357/fragments/3CKLXXI7D6XJO6EDVF6WQKCOYS","applicability":{"status":"MATCH","checks":[{"field":"scope","status":"MATCH","reason":"资料声明为通用知识。"}]}}],"gaps":[],"created_at":"2026-09-19T21:53:07.85035Z","applicability_checks":[{"revision_id":"RUXOEMOVWG2QL4G4YZ37SM6357","status":"MATCH","checks":[{"field":"scope","status":"MATCH","reason":"资料声明为通用知识。"}]}],"trace_id":"1612b4cad20ba254af5eae1419869d74","retrieved_fragment_ids":["3CKLXXI7D6XJO6EDVF6WQKCOYS","XOLPYMR6BZQPKS3IFXLH4OYZS6","3AN4DP22X6DTGYMMIYOHO5WNLN","L7BT4SI3OP6IUZD5BCTUXK3YQR","B7IUL7OSULLCR2EGTBHFHLFHZK"],"model_usage":{"prompt_tokens":885,"completion_tokens":157,"total_tokens":1042,"calls":1}}

{"schema_version":1,"id":"Z7Z3ZDYVFGWFLOAJW4OK7GNDC3","conversation_id":"Y6BDBEZHFKUIFU5R5MF2YJ6SD7","question":"直接替换 CCE 监听器关联的整个后端服务器组，可能有什么后果，应该怎么处理？","status":"ANSWERED","data_mode":"LIVE","answer":"通过ELB的控制台更换CCE创建的监听器后端服务器组属于高危操作，会导致Service/Ingress访问不通。

