{"schema_version":1,"id":"SM3HBDTJLLRBWSWNZWXY7QXDXY","conversation_id":"BEMMXYU3ZXSEQ27QACPNTCHO34","question":"想让业务用自建域名服务器，直接改宿主机 resolv.conf 有什么风险？正确做法是什么？","status":"ANSWERED","data_mode":"LIVE","answer":"直接修改宿主机/节点上的DNS配置（/etc/resolv.conf）属于高危操作，会导致内部域名无法正常访问，可能出现插件异常、节点重置升级等基本功能异常。

如果业务需要使用自建DNS，正确做法是在工作负载中配置DNS，请勿修改节点本身的DNS地址。

误操作修改节点DNS后，可参考新建节点中的DNS配置进行还原。","claims":[{"text":"直接修改宿主机/节点上的DNS配置（/etc/resolv.conf）属于高危操作，会导致内部域名无法正常访问，可能出现插件异常、节点重置升级等基本功能异常。","fragment_ids":["6OQW65RZHH6R72YGFYOSIZVRRP"]},{"text":"如果业务需要使用自建DNS，正确做法是在工作负载中配置DNS，请勿修改节点本身的DNS地址。","fragment_ids":["6OQW65RZHH6R72YGFYOSIZVRRP"]},{"text":"误操作修改节点DNS后，可参考新建节点中的DNS配置进行还原。","fragment_ids":["6OQW65RZHH6R72YGFYOSIZVRRP"]}],"citations":[{"document_id":"4KQSU5JF6WRCVNEX3MMWYJVQS7","revision_id":"RUXOEMOVWG2QL4G4YZ37SM6357","fragment_id":"6OQW65RZHH6R72YGFYOSIZVRRP","title":"华为云 CCE 高危操作一览","source":"https://support.huaweicloud.com/usermanual-cce/cce_10_0054.html","section":"cce-t1-r11 集群/节点 / Node节点","content_hash":"92f9fca2f546380a7b99f6055b0938b7df0fad23fa934ec92e7e3e164ae88f5e","url":"/v1/knowledge/revisions/RUXOEMOVWG2QL4G4YZ37SM6357/fragments/6OQW65RZHH6R72YGFYOSIZVRRP","applicability":{"status":"MATCH","checks":[{"field":"scope","status":"MATCH","reason":"资料声明为通用知识。"}]}}],"gaps":[],"created_at":"2026-09-19T21:52:47.603962Z","applicability_checks":[{"revision_id":"RUXOEMOVWG2QL4G4YZ37SM6357","status":"MATCH","checks":[{"field":"scope","status":"MATCH","reason":"资料声明为通用知识。"}]}],"trace_id":"d7f43820e5825b5336c082f754ec1b79","retrieved_fragment_ids":["6OQW65RZHH6R72YGFYOSIZVRRP","7U64KZA4GIQSJRLS2WMRN33YNA","IZJEZRRCGV2KA7YAJZEXOCTH6S","GKOROF7KVEPGLLUB2RKFBDEL4F","GVSV4MVQ7ITNOLT4AUXSASIFL3"],"model_usage":{"prompt_tokens":988,"completion_tokens":167,"total_tokens":1155,"calls":1}}

