{"schema_version":1,"id":"JDRSOUSR7KWIPCESAZPFVVNVO7","conversation_id":"TBOS3TTJWWYUYLRTKYUZUEXTJ2","question":"重装控制节点和普通工作节点的操作系统，文档给出的恢复结论有什么不同？","status":"ANSWERED","data_mode":"LIVE","answer":"控制节点重装操作系统的高危操作会导致控制节点组件被删除，误操作后解决方案为不可恢复。

Node节点（普通工作节点）重装操作系统的高危操作会导致节点组件被删除、节点不可用，误操作后解决方案为重置节点。

两者恢复结论不同：控制节点重装操作系统后不可恢复，而普通工作节点可通过重置节点恢复。","claims":[{"text":"控制节点重装操作系统的高危操作会导致控制节点组件被删除，误操作后解决方案为不可恢复。","fragment_ids":["274FGZVXA73JVT5DSNXG7R4AKE"]},{"text":"Node节点（普通工作节点）重装操作系统的高危操作会导致节点组件被删除、节点不可用，误操作后解决方案为重置节点。","fragment_ids":["QUAG6SLXXOWY4TGYAA3XCPFJK6"]},{"text":"两者恢复结论不同：控制节点重装操作系统后不可恢复，而普通工作节点可通过重置节点恢复。","fragment_ids":["274FGZVXA73JVT5DSNXG7R4AKE","QUAG6SLXXOWY4TGYAA3XCPFJK6"]}],"citations":[{"document_id":"4KQSU5JF6WRCVNEX3MMWYJVQS7","revision_id":"RUXOEMOVWG2QL4G4YZ37SM6357","fragment_id":"274FGZVXA73JVT5DSNXG7R4AKE","title":"华为云 CCE 高危操作一览","source":"https://support.huaweicloud.com/usermanual-cce/cce_10_0054.html","section":"cce-t1-r04 集群/节点 / 控制节点","content_hash":"85df2bf6103fb27facabb79b1b8c01bfa032c818b4a8fa3dbea860c7b2ae0bc5","url":"/v1/knowledge/revisions/RUXOEMOVWG2QL4G4YZ37SM6357/fragments/274FGZVXA73JVT5DSNXG7R4AKE","applicability":{"status":"MATCH","checks":[{"field":"scope","status":"MATCH","reason":"资料声明为通用知识。"}]}},{"document_id":"4KQSU5JF6WRCVNEX3MMWYJVQS7","revision_id":"RUXOEMOVWG2QL4G4YZ37SM6357","fragment_id":"QUAG6SLXXOWY4TGYAA3XCPFJK6","title":"华为云 CCE 高危操作一览","source":"https://support.huaweicloud.com/usermanual-cce/cce_10_0054.html","section":"cce-t1-r14 集群/节点 / Node节点","content_hash":"c30112cfd5546dd19aa110c816f1739d916af810e7abd3fc7d1502dc34dd5e52","url":"/v1/knowledge/revisions/RUXOEMOVWG2QL4G4YZ37SM6357/fragments/QUAG6SLXXOWY4TGYAA3XCPFJK6","applicability":{"status":"MATCH","checks":[{"field":"scope","status":"MATCH","reason":"资料声明为通用知识。"}]}}],"gaps":[],"created_at":"2026-09-19T21:50:28.137275Z","applicability_checks":[{"revision_id":"RUXOEMOVWG2QL4G4YZ37SM6357","status":"MATCH","checks":[{"field":"scope","status":"MATCH","reason":"资料声明为通用知识。"}]}],"trace_id":"4004f7bbd6d251d2d9e6e2c4b42eda04","retrieved_fragment_ids":["274FGZVXA73JVT5DSNXG7R4AKE","WU2TZZNKLVLIWI6CHKLMVKEHNM","I7DRU6FIQDNAMKI55BMR6MFJ6F","QUAG6SLXXOWY4TGYAA3XCPFJK6","DL52JJRFWSTU7JHQRM2TUYHFFD"],"model_usage":{"prompt_tokens":833,"completion_tokens":179,"tota