{"schema_version":1,"id":"4RG2EA6A7AGQJ3FKIHVYR4PH6U","conversation_id":"6QL4QILLYSNXAFFZZH33VGRHLV","question":"创建 PV 的 YAML 带着 status、spec.claimRef 和 set-disk-metadata，会有什么风险，删除前如何纠正？","status":"ANSWERED","data_mode":"LIVE","answer":"创建PV时YAML中涉及status、spec.claimRef以及annotation.everest.io/set-disk-metadata等参数属于带有未在文档中声明的参数的高危操作，可能造成PV异常。

